      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Newstead%2C_Queensland"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Newstead Heritage Trail traces the confluence of Breakfast Creek and the Brisbane River, a site vital to Aboriginal people.",
